<p style=\"margin-right:-.05pt; text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">ฤแป“ng ch&iacute; Trung t&aacute;, TS Phแบกm Vฤn Dลฉng -&nbsp;Ph&oacute; Gi&aacute;m ฤ‘แป‘c Bแปnh viแปn Qu&acirc;n y 7 </span></em><em><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">ch&uacute;c mแปซng th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng ฤแบกi hแปi</span></em></p>

<p style=\"margin-right:-0.05pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Tham dแปฑ <span style=\"color:black\">ฤ‘แบกi hแปi c&ograve;n c&oacute; c&aacute;c ฤ‘แป“ng ch&iacute; trong ฤแบฃng แปงy Bแปnh viแปn; chแป huy c&aacute;c khoa, ph&ograve;ng, ban</span>; ฤ‘แบกi diแปn BCH C&ocirc;ng ฤ‘o&agrave;n, Hแปi Phแปฅ nแปฏ v&agrave; 66 c&aacute;n bแป, ฤ‘o&agrave;n vi&ecirc;n thanh ni&ecirc;n to&agrave;n Bแปnh viแปn.</span></p>

<p style=\"margin-right:-0.05pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/source/ngay7-10-2025/1759824242thanhnien1.png\" style=\"width:100%\" /></span></p>

<p style=\"margin-right:-0.05pt; text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">C&aacute;c ฤ‘แบกi biแปu tham dแปฑ ฤ‘แบกi hแปi</span></em></p>

<p style=\"margin-right:-0.05pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Trong giai ฤ‘oแบกn 2022-2025, Ban Chแบฅp h&agrave;nh ฤo&agrave;n cฦก sแป ฤ‘&atilde; b&aacute;m s&aacute;t sแปฑ l&atilde;nh ฤ‘แบกo, chแป ฤ‘แบกo cแปงa ฤแบฃng แปงy, chแป huy Bแปnh viแปn; triแปn khai nhiแปu hoแบกt ฤ‘แปng cแปฅ thแป, thiแบฟt thแปฑc mang lแบกi hiแปu quแบฃ cao tr&ecirc;n c&aacute;c mแบทt c&ocirc;ng t&aacute;c nhฦฐ gi&aacute;o dแปฅc ch&iacute;nh trแป tฦฐ tฦฐแปng, r&egrave;n luyแปn n&acirc;ng cao bแบฃn lฤฉnh ch&iacute;nh trแป cho ฤ‘o&agrave;n vi&ecirc;n, thanh ni&ecirc;n; thแปฑc hiแปn c&aacute;c phong tr&agrave;o thi ฤ‘ua, gแบฏn vแปi c&aacute;c phong tr&agrave;o h&agrave;nh ฤ‘แปng c&aacute;ch mแบกng; c&ocirc;ng t&aacute;c x&acirc;y dแปฑng tแป• chแปฉc ฤ‘o&agrave;n, ฤ‘o&agrave;n tham gia x&acirc;y dแปฑng ฤ‘แบฃng; c&ocirc;ng t&aacute;c phแป‘i hแปฃp hoแบกt ฤ‘แปng vแปi tแป• chแปฉc ฤ‘o&agrave;n ฤ‘แปa phฦฐฦกng, ฤ‘ฦกn vแป kแบฟt nghฤฉa.</span></p>

<p style=\"margin-right:-0.05pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/source/ngay7-10-2025/1759824242thanhnien2.png\" style=\"width:100%\" /></span></p>

