<p style=\"margin-right:-0.05pt; text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Quang cแบฃnh cแปงa ฤแบกi hแปi</span></em></p>

<p style=\"margin-right:-0.05pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Tแบกi ฤแบกi hแปi, c&aacute;c ฤ‘แบกi biแปu ฤ‘&atilde; ph&aacute;t huy d&acirc;n chแปง, tr&aacute;ch nhiแปm, thแบณng thแบฏn ฤ‘&aacute;nh gi&aacute; ฤ‘&uacute;ng thแปฑc trแบกng c&ocirc;ng t&aacute;c ฤo&agrave;n v&agrave; phong tr&agrave;o thanh ni&ecirc;n trong giai ฤ‘oแบกn qua; ฤ‘แป“ng thแปi chแป r&otilde; hแบกn chแบฟ, nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n v&agrave; ฤ‘แป ra nhiแปu giแบฃi ph&aacute;p trแปng t&acirc;m nhแบฑm n&acirc;ng cao chแบฅt lฦฐแปฃng, hiแปu quแบฃ hoแบกt ฤ‘แปng cแปงa tแป• chแปฉc ฤo&agrave;n trong nhiแปm kแปณ mแปi.</span></p>

