<p style=\"margin-right:-0.05pt; text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">ฤแบกi hแปi bแบงu cแปญ Ban Chแบฅp h&agrave;nh ฤo&agrave;n cฦก sแป Bแปnh viแปn nhiแปm kแปณ 2025-2030</span></em></p>

<p style=\"margin-right:-0.05pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">ฤแบกi hแปi ฤ‘&atilde; bแบงu Ban Chแบฅp h&agrave;nh ฤo&agrave;n cฦก sแป Bแปnh viแปn nhiแปm kแปณ 2025 </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"> 2030 gแป“m 06 ฤ‘แป“ng ch&iacute;; trong ฤ‘&oacute;, ฤ‘แป“ng ch&iacute; Trung t&aacute; Phแบกm Vฤn ฤแบกo </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"> Trแปฃ l&yacute;, Ph&ograve;ng Ch&iacute;nh trแป ฤ‘ฦฐแปฃc t&iacute;n nhiแปm bแบงu giแปฏ chแปฉc B&iacute; thฦฐ ฤo&agrave;n cฦก sแป Bแปnh viแปn nhiแปm kแปณ 2025-2030.</span></p>

